Part  C  –  Availability:  The  attack  was  corrupting  or  deleting  records  from  the  grades  file,  
making
 
the
 
information
 
unavailable.
 
A
 
backup
 
and
 
recovery
 
process
 
restored
 
the
 
complete
 
file
 
and
 
returned
 
the
 
data
 
to
 
use.
 
One
 
